# Frequent, neat commits

Commit Quinovo work in small focused slices and push to `origin`.

- Imperative subject that states the why, not a file list.
- Add a one-sentence body when the why is not obvious from the subject.
- One concern per commit. Do not mix a secret fix with a feature.
- Do not use subjects like `checkpoint`, `wip`, `temp`, or `misc`.
- Author and committer are `cfollette18`. No Cursor trailer.
